{
  "info": {
    "name": "CodeLabs Billing Cloud",
    "description": "Colección completa de la API de CodeLabs Billing Cloud.\n\n**Cómo usar:**\n1. Importar la colección y el environment (local o dev).\n2. Obtener token: `make token` (local) o usar el script `local/scripts/auth.py`.\n3. Pegar el token en la variable `token` del environment.\n4. Para endpoints de tenant, completar `tenant_id`.\n\n**Environments:**\n- `local` → http://localhost:8000/api/v1 (debug con F5)\n- `dev`   → https://api-billing-dev.codelabsecuador.com/api/v1",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "version": "2.1.0"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "System",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/../health",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["..", "health"]
            },
            "description": "Verifica que la API está levantada. No requiere autenticación."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "{\"status\": \"ok\", \"env\": \"local\"}" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /config/sri",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/config/sri",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["config", "sri"]
            },
            "description": "Devuelve catálogos SRI vigentes: tarifas IVA, formas de pago, tipos de identificación.\nEl frontend usa este endpoint para pre-rellenar formularios."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"iva_vigente\": { \"codigo_porcentaje\": \"4\", \"tarifa\": 15.0, \"descripcion\": \"IVA 15% (vigente)\" },\n  \"tarifas_disponibles\": [...],\n  \"formas_pago\": [...],\n  \"tipos_identificacion\": [...]\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /auth/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Perfil del usuario autenticado según el JWT de Cognito.\nDevuelve: user_id, email, tenant_id, role, is_superadmin."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"cognito-sub-uuid\",\n  \"email\": \"admin@empresa.com\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Juan Pérez\",\n  \"tenant_id\": \"uuid-del-tenant\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\",\n  \"is_superadmin\": false\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Tenants",
      "description": "CRUD de tenants. Todos los endpoints requieren rol superadmin.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /tenants",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants?offset=0&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "50" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista todos los tenants. Solo superadmin."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "[{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"ruc\": \"1234567890001\", \"razon_social\": \"Empresa S.A.\", \"estado\": \"TRIAL\", \"ambiente_sri\": \"PRUEBAS\", \"comprobantes_mes_actual\": 0}]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /tenants",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ruc\": \"1234567890001\",\n  \"razon_social\": \"Mi Empresa S.A.\",\n  \"nombre_comercial\": \"Mi Empresa\",\n  \"ambiente_sri\": \"PRUEBAS\",\n  \"admin_email\": \"admin@miempresa.com\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Crea un tenant + usuario admin en Cognito + envía email de bienvenida.\n\n**Campos requeridos:**\n- `ruc`: 13 dígitos exactos\n- `razon_social`: nombre legal\n- `admin_email`: correo del administrador del tenant\n\n**Resultado:** el admin recibe un email con sus credenciales de acceso."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('tenant_id', body.id);",
                  "  pm.test('tenant_id guardado', () => pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "body": "{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"ruc\": \"1234567890001\", \"razon_social\": \"Mi Empresa S.A.\", \"estado\": \"TRIAL\", \"ambiente_sri\": \"PRUEBAS\", \"comprobantes_mes_actual\": 0}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 RUC duplicado",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "body": "{\"detail\": {\"code\": \"TENANT_ALREADY_EXISTS\", \"message\": \"Ya existe un tenant con RUC 1234567890001\"}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /tenants/:tenant_id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Superadmin ve cualquier tenant; admin de tenant solo el suyo."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "{\"id\": \"{{tenant_id}}\", \"ruc\": \"1234567890001\", \"estado\": \"ACTIVE\"}" },
            { "name": "404 Not Found", "status": "Not Found", "code": 404, "body": "{\"detail\": {\"code\": \"NOT_FOUND\"}}" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /tenants/:tenant_id",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"estado\": \"ACTIVE\",\n  \"ambiente_sri\": \"PRUEBAS\",\n  \"nombre_comercial\": \"Nuevo nombre\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Actualiza tenant. Solo superadmin.\n\n**Estados:** TRIAL | ACTIVE | PAYMENT_DUE | GRACE_PERIOD | SUSPENDED | CANCELLED"
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "{\"id\": \"{{tenant_id}}\", \"estado\": \"ACTIVE\"}" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Establecimientos",
      "description": "Gestión de establecimientos y puntos de emisión SRI por tenant.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /tenants/:tenant_id/establecimientos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/establecimientos",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}", "establecimientos"]
            },
            "description": "Lista los establecimientos del tenant."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "[{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"codigo\": \"001\", \"direccion\": \"Av. Principal 123\", \"estado\": \"ACTIVE\"}]" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /tenants/:tenant_id/establecimientos",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/establecimientos",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}", "establecimientos"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"codigo\": \"001\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Av. Principal 123, Quito\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Crea un establecimiento. `codigo` es el código SRI de 3 dígitos (ej: 001)."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "201 Created", "status": "Created", "code": 201, "body": "{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"codigo\": \"001\", \"estado\": \"ACTIVE\"}" },
            { "name": "409 Ya existe", "status": "Conflict", "code": 409, "body": "{\"detail\": \"Establecimiento 001 ya existe\"}" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /tenants/:tenant_id/establecimientos/:codigo",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/establecimientos/001",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}", "establecimientos", "001"]
            },
            "description": "Elimina un establecimiento. Código SRI de 3 dígitos."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "204 No Content", "status": "No Content", "code": 204, "body": "" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /tenants/:tenant_id/establecimientos/:codigo/puntos-emision",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/establecimientos/001/puntos-emision",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}", "establecimientos", "001", "puntos-emision"]
            },
            "description": "Lista los puntos de emisión de un establecimiento."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "[{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"codigo\": \"001\", \"estado\": \"ACTIVE\"}]" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /tenants/:tenant_id/establecimientos/:codigo/puntos-emision",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/establecimientos/001/puntos-emision",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}", "establecimientos", "001", "puntos-emision"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"codigo\": \"001\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Crea un punto de emisión. `codigo` de 3 dígitos (ej: 001)."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "201 Created", "status": "Created", "code": 201, "body": "{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"codigo\": \"001\", \"estado\": \"ACTIVE\"}" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Comprobantes",
      "description": "Emisión y consulta de comprobantes electrónicos.\n\n**Flujo de emisión:**\n1. POST /comprobantes → crea y encola\n2. El worker procesa: genera XML, firma, envía al SRI\n3. GET /comprobantes/:id → monitorea el estado\n4. Descarga XML/PDF cuando estado = AUTHORIZED",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /comprobantes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/comprobantes?offset=0&limit=20",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["comprobantes"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "offset", "value": "0" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "20" },
                { "key": "estado", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista comprobantes del tenant. Filtros opcionales: `estado` (AUTHORIZED, QUEUED, FAILED, etc.)"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\"items\": [{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"tipo\": \"01\", \"estado\": \"AUTHORIZED\", \"clave_acceso\": \"...\"}], \"total\": 1, \"offset\": 0, \"limit\": 20}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /comprobantes",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/comprobantes",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["comprobantes"]
            },
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}", "description": "UUID único por emisión — evita duplicados en reintentos" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tipo\": \"01\",\n  \"establecimiento\": \"001\",\n  \"punto_emision\": \"001\",\n  \"datos\": {\n    \"tipo_identificacion_comprador\": \"05\",\n    \"identificacion_comprador\": \"1234567890\",\n    \"razon_social_comprador\": \"Cliente Prueba\",\n    \"email_comprador\": \"cliente@test.com\",\n    \"fecha_emision\": \"04/06/2026\",\n    \"detalles\": [\n      {\n        \"codigo_principal\": \"PROD001\",\n        \"descripcion\": \"Producto de prueba\",\n        \"cantidad\": 1,\n        \"precio_unitario\": 10.00,\n        \"descuento\": 0,\n        \"precio_total_sin_impuesto\": 10.00,\n        \"impuestos\": [\n          {\n            \"codigo\": \"2\",\n            \"codigo_porcentaje\": \"4\",\n            \"tarifa\": 15.0,\n            \"base_imponible\": 10.00,\n            \"valor\": 1.50\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"total_sin_impuestos\": 10.00,\n    \"total_descuento\": 0,\n    \"importe_total\": 11.50,\n    \"pagos\": [\n      {\n        \"forma_pago\": \"01\",\n        \"total\": 11.50\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Emite un comprobante electrónico. Responde 202 (aceptado para procesamiento asíncrono).\n\n**tipo:** 01=Factura, 04=NotaCredito, 05=NotaDebito\n**IVA 15%:** codigo_porcentaje='4', tarifa=15.0\n**IVA 0%:** codigo_porcentaje='0', tarifa=0.0"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('comprobante_id', body.id);",
                  "  pm.test('comprobante_id guardado', () => pm.expect(body.id).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "202 Accepted",
              "status": "Accepted",
              "code": 202,
              "body": "{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"tipo\": \"01\", \"establecimiento\": \"001\", \"punto_emision\": \"001\", \"estado\": \"QUEUED\", \"secuencial\": \"000000001\"}"
            },
            {
              "name": "422 Establecimiento no encontrado",
              "status": "Unprocessable Entity",
              "code": 422,
              "body": "{\"detail\": \"Establecimiento 001 no encontrado para este tenant\"}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /comprobantes/:comprobante_id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/comprobantes/{{comprobante_id}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["comprobantes", "{{comprobante_id}}"]
            },
            "description": "Consulta el estado actual de un comprobante.\n\n**Estados posibles:** QUEUED → PROCESSING → XML_SIGNED → SENT_TO_SRI → AUTHORIZED | NOT_AUTHORIZED | FAILED"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — Autorizado",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"estado\": \"AUTHORIZED\", \"numero_autorizacion\": \"...\", \"clave_acceso\": \"...\"}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK — En cola",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"estado\": \"QUEUED\", \"numero_autorizacion\": null}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH /comprobantes/:comprobante_id/retry",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/comprobantes/{{comprobante_id}}/retry",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["comprobantes", "{{comprobante_id}}", "retry"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tipo\": \"REENVIAR_SRI\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Reintenta el procesamiento de un comprobante fallido.\n\n**tipos:**\n- `REENVIAR_SRI` → re-envía al SRI (desde FAILED/RETURNED_BY_SRI)\n- `RECONSULTAR_AUTORIZACION` → consulta estado en SRI (desde RETRY_PENDING)\n- `REENVIAR_EMAIL` → reenvía el email al receptor (desde EMAIL_FAILED)"
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"estado\": \"QUEUED\"}" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /comprobantes/:comprobante_id/descargar/xml",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/comprobantes/{{comprobante_id}}/descargar/xml",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["comprobantes", "{{comprobante_id}}", "descargar", "xml"]
            },
            "description": "Genera presigned URL para descargar el XML autorizado. URL válida 15 minutos."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "{\"url\": \"https://s3.amazonaws.com/...\", \"expires_in\": 900}" },
            { "name": "404 XML no disponible", "status": "Not Found", "code": 404, "body": "{\"detail\": \"XML no disponible aún\"}" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /comprobantes/:comprobante_id/descargar/pdf",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/comprobantes/{{comprobante_id}}/descargar/pdf",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["comprobantes", "{{comprobante_id}}", "descargar", "pdf"]
            },
            "description": "Genera presigned URL para descargar el RIDE (PDF). URL válida 15 minutos."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "{\"url\": \"https://s3.amazonaws.com/...\", \"expires_in\": 900}" }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Certificates",
      "description": "Gestión de certificados de firma electrónica por tenant.\n\n**Flujo de carga (3 pasos):**\n1. `POST upload-url` → presigned URL de S3\n2. `PUT` directo a S3 con el archivo .p12\n3. `POST confirm` → valida y guarda en Secrets Manager",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /tenants/:tenant_id/certificates",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/certificates",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}", "certificates"]
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "body": "[{\"id\": \"uuid\", \"nombre\": \"Certificado BCE 2024\", \"fecha_expiracion\": \"2026-01-15\", \"estado\": \"ACTIVE\"}]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /tenants/:tenant_id/certificates/upload-url",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/certificates/upload-url",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}", "certificates", "upload-url"]
            },
            "description": "**Paso 1:** Genera presigned URL de S3. La URL expira en 300s."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.environment.set('cert_id', body.cert_id);",
                  "  pm.environment.set('s3_upload_url', body.upload_url);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "{\"upload_url\": \"https://s3...\", \"cert_id\": \"uuid\", \"expires_in_seconds\": 300}" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT S3 — subir .p12",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{s3_upload_url}}",
              "host": ["{{s3_upload_url}}"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-pkcs12" }],
            "body": { "mode": "file", "file": {} },
            "description": "**Paso 2:** Sube el .p12 directamente a S3. Sin Authorization header."
          },
          "response": [
            { "name": "200 OK (body vacío)", "status": "OK", "code": 200, "body": "" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /tenants/:tenant_id/certificates/confirm",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/tenants/{{tenant_id}}/certificates/confirm",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["tenants", "{{tenant_id}}", "certificates", "confirm"]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cert_id\": \"{{cert_id}}\",\n  \"s3_key_upload\": \"tenants/{{tenant_id}}/certs/uploads/{{cert_id}}.p12\",\n  \"password\": \"contraseña-del-p12\",\n  \"nombre\": \"Certificado BCE 2024\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
